{"bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20240705\/20240705111521_34723.png","category_id":"6a157626b0cd2e35d86fcf74","column_id":"6a154fc77093015d5705df9a","create_time":"2024-07-05 11:13:35","details":"<p style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:&quot;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/img1.dxycdn.com\/p\/s14\/2024\/0704\/557\/8864979131494678081.png\" width=\"300\" \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:&quot;\">\r\n\t中文名称：替尔泊肽侧链；C20脂肪酸侧链\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:&quot;\">\r\n\t英文名称：Tirzepatide Side Chain；LY1001\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:&quot;\">\r\n\t产品简称：C20-OtBu-Glu(OtBu)-AEEA-AEEA-OH\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:&quot;\">\r\n\tCAS no.：1188328-37-1\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:&quot;\">\r\n\t产品编码：06040007100\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:&quot;\">\r\n\t储存：-20±5℃\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\" style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:&quot;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:&quot;\">\r\n\t作为Tirzepatide（替尔泊肽\/替西帕肽）等重要药物的关键侧链，C20-OtBu-Glu(OtBu)-AEEA-AEEA-OH在药物合成中发挥着不可替代的作用。它能够有效地促进药物分子的构建，提高药物的生物活性和靶向性，为疾病治疗带来新的突破。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:&quot;\">\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:&quot;\">\r\n\t厦门赛诺邦格生物科技股份有限公司等企业在药物递送系统（DDS）和医用新材料领域有着深厚的技术储备。C20-OtBu-Glu(OtBu)-AEEA-AEEA-OH作为这些系统的重要组成部分，能够提升药物的溶解性、稳定性和生物利用度，为长效药物研发提供有力支持。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:&quot;\">\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:&quot;\">\r\n\t随着全球医药市场的不断扩大，对高品质医药中间体的需求日益增长。C20-OtBu-Glu(OtBu)-AEEA-AEEA-OH作为一款性能卓越的医药中间体，其市场前景十分广阔。尤其是在糖尿病、心血管疾病等全球性疾病高发的背景下，Tirzepatide等降糖药物的市场需求将持续增长，进一步推动C20-OtBu-Glu(OtBu)-AEEA-AEEA-OH的市场发展。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:&quot;\">\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:&quot;\">\r\n\t<p style=\"color:#191B1F;font-family:-apple-system, Ma